abstract: >-
  CIDOC CRM knowledge graph of historical inventories of Tyrolean castles and
  residences (14th–17th century). It models the inventory documents, their
  creation and modification, the persons involved and their roles, the castles
  and their rooms, the recorded objects with their annotated text segments,
  and castle ownership. Provided in two equivalent serialisations: TriG-star
  (RDF-star) and N-Quads with property classes (CIDOC CRM v7.1.3 PC module).
